# Privacy Policy for Postiz Self-Hosted

Last updated: October 26, 2026

This privacy policy applies to the self-hosted Postiz automation tool operated locally by the user. 

## Information Collection
This application is self-hosted on private local hardware. We do not collect, store, or share any personal data on external commercial servers. All data processed via Meta APIs (Instagram/Facebook) is used strictly for local scheduling and content management purposes.

## Contact
For any questions regarding privacy, please contact the system administrator directly.
